# Phase 14 – Notifications & Banner System

Implement engagement systems: backend API endpoints for banners and announcements, local SQLite persistence/sync on the mobile client, and front-end UI integrations.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Dependency Addition:** We will add `url_launcher` to the `pubspec.yaml` of the Flutter application to handle "Banner Linking" (opening the URL when a user taps a promotional banner).
> - **Database Schema Upgrade:** The local SQLite database version on the mobile client will be upgraded to `2` to introduce the `banners_cache` and `announcements_cache` tables. This upgrade is backward-compatible and preserves user progress (Leitner state).

## Open Questions

> [!NOTE]
> There are no unresolved open questions. We will use the Announcements database table to power both the system-wide announcements and notifications screen, which matches the admin panel and existing database schema.

