## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Create a unit/integration test file [notifications_test.dart](file:///e:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/mobile-app/test/notifications_test.dart) to verify:
  - SQLite schema upgrade path.
  - Caching and 24-hour sync rule logic (remote call occurs when time threshold is exceeded; local cache is used when within threshold or offline).
- Run all tests using:
  ```powershell
  cd mobile-app
  flutter test test/notifications_test.dart
  flutter test
  ```

### Manual Verification
1. Run backend server local development build (`dotnet run` or similar).
2. Use Admin Panel to create sample banners (with image URLs and link URLs) and announcements.
3. Launch mobile client in emulator/device, verify banner carousel loads active banners, auto-rotates every 4 seconds, and handles redirection links.
4. Open Notification Center, verify announcements/notifications list is correctly populated (sorted descending by timestamp).
5. Toggle internet connection off (airplane mode), relaunch mobile app, and verify that cached banners and announcements/notifications load successfully.
